// check: accepted
// CROWN modal (§11 6.3's crucible sweep): MASK COMPOSITION — nested
// installs of the SAME effect. The inner absorbs, the outer decl's !E
// holds, and dispatch picks the INNERMOST (measured: runs 1, h1's
// answer — the mn-escape-innermost law at the static-nesting shape).
// Expect NO E_EffectMismatch.
effect E { op() -> Int }
handler h1 { op() => resume(1) }
handler h2 { op() => resume(2) }
fn work() = op()
fn f() with !E = ((work()) ~> h1) ~> h2
fn main() = f()
